  "body": "### Description\r\n\r\nThe metric \"synapse_admin_mau_current\" always gives me 0 since the installation.\r\n\r\n### Steps to reproduce\r\n\r\n- Install synapse\r\n- activate metric\r\n\r\n\r\n### Homeserver\r\n\r\nrollenspiel.chat\r\n\r\n### Synapse Version\r\n\r\n1.94.0\r\n\r\n### Installation Method\r\n\r\nDebian packages from packages.matrix.org\r\n\r\n### Database\r\n\r\nPostgreSQL\r\n\r\n### Workers\r\n\r\nSingle process\r\n\r\n### Platform\r\n\r\nDieban 12 (Bookworm) as VM on a Proxmox installation.\r\n\r\n### Configuration\r\n\r\nlisteners:\r\n  - port: 8008\r\n    tls: false\r\n    type: http\r\n    x_forwarded: true\r\n    bind_addresses: ['0.0.0.0']\r\n    resources:\r\n      - names: [client, federation, health]\r\n        compress: false\r\n  # beginning of the new metrics listener\r\n  - port: 9000\r\n    type: metrics\r\n    bind_addresses: ['0.0.0.0']\r\nenable_metrics: true\r\n\r\n### Relevant log output\r\n\r\n```shell\r\nthe following line is repeated again and again, otherwise nothing with metric occurs in the log\r\n\r\n2023-10-17 00:03:53,370 - synapse.metrics._gc - 120 - INFO - sentinel - Collecting gc 1\r\n```\r\n\r\n\r\n### Anything else that would be useful to know?\r\n\r\n_No response_",
